          "id": "1ab6e535-0b4c-4918-a801-0d356ad97f6e",
          "name": "Search Contracts",
          "request": {
            "name": "Search Contracts",
            "description": {
              "content": "Search contracts (retool.contract_data).\n\nThree orthogonal text inputs, AND'd together:\n\n- ``vendors``: array of vendor terms (weight A in text_search_strict)\n- ``products``: array of product terms (weight B in text_search_strict)\n- ``query``: free-text over raw_text (text_search_prose, english config)\n\nSee ContractSearchFilters docstring for the full syntax. All filters are\noptional — the table is small enough (~7K rows) to allow unbounded scans.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "api",
                "internal",
                "contracts",
                "search"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
